@startuml F01-flow
title F01 — Capture lead optimiste (POV UI)
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
actor Salma
participant "LeadCaptureStep" as UI
participant "react-hook-form" as RHF
participant "wizard-store" as Store
participant "lead-sync-queue" as Q
participant "/api/checkout/lead" as API

Salma -> UI : remplit prénom/téléphone/consent
UI -> RHF : validation onChange
RHF --> UI : isValid=true -> submit ENABLED
Salma -> UI : clic "Continuer"
alt flag ON (optimiste)
  UI -> Store : setLeadId(newLeadId) + goToStep('address')
  Store --> Salma : étape address visible (< 1.5s)
  UI -> Q : enqueue(lead_create) [non-awaité]
  Q -> API : POST (en fond, Idempotency-Key)
else flag OFF (legacy)
  UI -> API : await createLead()
  API --> UI : 201
  UI -> Store : goToStep('address')
end
note over UI : honeypot rempli => succès silencieux, aucun envoi
@enduml
